WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.234
-Welcome back.
-Jimmy!

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:03.567
-I'm so happy to see you.
-I'm so happy to see you.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.200
-I love you. I miss you.
-I miss you.

