00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:16.968
Did you have a party?
That's interesting if you did.

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:18.934
-No, no, no. I didn't, I didn't.
-Yeah, of course not. Yeah.

00:01:18.934 --> 00:01:20.234
-We just stayed at home.
