00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:36.968
-I was going to say
do you remember that?

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:37.968
'Cause it was a surprise party.

00:01:37.968 --> 00:01:39.167
-It was a surprise birthday.

00:01:39.167 --> 00:01:41.334
And you guys were all stuck
in the bathroom

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:44.834
