-I was in the bathtub.

00:01:44.834 --> 00:01:47.167
It was Gwyneth Paltrow's house.

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:50.200
And it was a surprise party
for you and you were late.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.334
