00:02:05.901 --> 00:02:09.167
There was like 10 of us in this
bathroom waiting for you.

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:11.567
-I wish -- Somebody has
a picture of it, by the way.

00:02:11.567 --> 00:02:13.033
It's, like, really funny.

00:02:13.033 --> 00:02:15.334
We should have thought of
something a little bit.

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:16.634
We should've had that picture.
-Yeah, we should've

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:18.501
